00:09:21.342 --> 00:09:23.298
That doesn't mean that every
day is amazing and happy,

00:09:23.298 --> 00:09:25.045
and all that your doing
is work that you enjoy,

00:09:25.045 --> 00:09:26.649
there's a lot of crap that comes with it.

00:09:26.649 --> 00:09:28.137
Being a parent, there's a lot of crap

00:09:28.137 --> 00:09:29.311
that comes with being a parent.

00:09:29.311 --> 00:09:31.704
But you got to do the work,
you got to put in the time.

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:34.618
You got to love your kids if
you want to be a great parent,

00:09:34.618 --> 00:09:37.465
and the reward is definitely worth it,

00:09:37.465 --> 00:09:39.134
over the pain that comes with it,

00:09:39.134 --> 00:09:41.002
